# Implementation Plan - HOTFIX-013 — Remove Console Window From Production Executable

Configure PyInstaller build specification to produce a windowed GUI application (`console=False`) that launches without a visible CMD console window on Windows.

## Proposed Changes

### Packaging Layer

#### [MODIFY] [batmanoverlay.spec](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/batmanoverlay.spec)
- Change `console=True` to `console=False` in `EXE(...)` block.
- This instructs PyInstaller to set the PE header subsystem to `IMAGE_SUBSYSTEM_WINDOWS_GUI` instead of `IMAGE_SUBSYSTEM_WINDOWS_CUI`.

